					"content": "但现在…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220210708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龟井宗久"
				},
				{
					"id": 220210708,
					"content": "往事就不提了，鸟蛋就拜托阁下了。",
